; hetu: the reason — why we inquire.
; second limb of panchaavayava.
; "we seek: kinetic-energy of ball-A"
;
; hetu is not the question itself (that is prashna).
; hetu is the ground of the question — the reason the answer matters.
; in the pipeline: the solve-for concept + scope entity.

(sangati hetu
  (swarupa pratijnaa)
  (sthita vak-sthalam)
  (kriya darshana)
  (janya prashna)
  (phala udaharana))
